      "width": 1600,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "Pirelli’s focus High-end and prestige markets Premium products Prestige brand",
      "title": "",
      "original_description_html": "<p>Pirelli’s focus High-end and prestige markets Premium products Prestige brand</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "FqEHec",
      "number": 10,
      "image": "decks/d9cb1e4d3aa1de36d631ac039034b31bba83aa34d33f37c848c61cf46b00066f/0010.jpg",
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "From whence we came Standard story: everything on-prem at data centers and in factories",
      "title": "",
      "original_description_html": "<p>From whence we came Standard story: everything on-prem at data centers and in factories</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9x5X1",
      "number": 11,
      "image": "decks/d9cb1e4d3aa1de36d631ac039034b31bba83aa34d33f37c848c61cf46b00066f/0011.jpg",
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 900,
      "text": "Moving to the cloud… Nearly 150 years of legacy More than just software",
      "title": "",
      "original_description_html": "<p>Moving to the cloud… Nearly 150 years of legacy More than just software</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "UTftPQ",
      "number": 12,
